('cso-swami-vivekananda-youth-movement-svym-7e46aa28', 'Swami Vivekananda Youth Movement (SVYM)', 'SVYM is a development organization based in Karnataka working to build a new civil society through programs in health, education, socio-economic development, and research, primarily serving rural and tribal communities.', 'SVYM Home About Organisation History People Awards Partners News Statutory Compliance Reports Our Work Education Health Socio-Economic Empowerment Environment & Sustainability Institutions CSR Partnerships Engage With Us Events Careers Internships & Electives Volunteer Visit Us Contact SSE Home About Organisation History People Awards Partners News Statutory Compliance Reports Our Work Education Health Socio-Economic Empowerment Environment & Sustainability Institutions CSR Partnerships Engage With Us Events Careers Internships & Electives Volunteer Visit Us Donate Contact SSE Donate What is Human & Social Capital? Development is the constant expansion of human capabilities Building the inner resilience of people and communities Individuals, institutions & countries alike are realising the unsustainable nature of the current economic growth practices and are exploring other viable and sustainable models of development that focus on building human capabilities. SVYM has been actively advocating the paradigm of building the human and social capital of people with the conviction that this will result in economic consequences keeping in mind a balance that is needed to protect the peop', 'Govt of India', 'Office of Registrar of Companies, Ministry of Corporate Affairs, Govt of India, CSR00002215', 'Govt of India', null, 'India', 'info@svymna.org', '247059) 0 0 60', 'https://svym.org', '{"youtube": "https://youtube.com/@svymindia", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/svym.india", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/svym", "instagram": "http://instagram.com/svym.india", "linkedin": "https://in.linkedin.com/company/swami-vivekananda-youth-movement"}'::jsonb, 