('cso-prayas-d531c23e', 'Prayas', 'Prayas is a group of voluntary organizations and individuals working on issues of energy, governance, health, and child rights, focusing on policy research and advocacy for equity and justice.', 'Prayas आरोग्य, ऊर्जा, शिक्षण आणि पालकत्व या विषयातील विशेष प्रयत्न PRAYAS - Initiatives in Health, Energy, Learning and Parenthood ENERGY HEALTH About Prayas PRAYAS (Initiatives in Health, Energy, Learning and Parenthood) is a non-governmental, non-profit organization based in Pune, India. Members of Prayas are professionals working to protect and promote public interest in general and the interests of disadvantaged sections of society in particular. Prayas - Initiatives in Health, Energy, Learning and Parenthood, is a not-for-profit trust based at Pune, India, registered under the Mumbai Charitable Trusts Act, 1950. We currently work in two areas, viz. Energy, and Health. At Prayas, we apply our professional knowledge and skills to understand the issues affecting society in these areas, and strive to translate this understanding to strategic and sensitive responses. Underlying these responses is our belief that, if equipped with adequate information, sound analyses, and necessary skills, the disadvantaged section of society can tackle their problems and shape their own future. Our activities - research, policy analysis, information dissemination, policy and regulatory engagement i', 'Pune, Maharashtra', 'Gymkhana, Pune, Maharashtra - 411 004, India', 'Pune', 'Maharashtra', 'India', 'health@prayaspune.org', '+91-8605882649', 'https://www.prayaspune.org', '{}'::jsonb, '["Pune, India"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Energy Policy', 'Health', 'Governance', 'Social Justice', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Think Tanks', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Energy Policy', 'Health', 'Governance', 'Social Justice', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Think Tanks', 'Prayas']::text[], 18.5213738, 73.8545071, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://www.prayaspune.org', '{"areas_of