('cso-asar-2ae7fe2e', 'Asar', 'Asar Social Impact Advisors is a development consulting firm that works with governments, nonprofits, and donors to design, implement, and evaluate social programs across India.', 'Asar | Climate Futures, Together Share this powerful gallery of art and climate. These paintings speak of survival, resistance, and care. Share this page with those who value community, creativity, and climate justice. Copy link or share via social media Language About Our Team Our Work Virtual Exhibition: Art, Women & Climate Justice Knowledge Hub Reports Videos Blogs Newsroom Events Life at Asar Careers Engage with Us Contact Us LinkedIn Youtube Language Contact us Home Climate futures Together Celebrating 10 Years of Asar Asar Social Impact Advisors is a startup in the environment and social justice impact space with a commitment to building climate resilience and ambitious climate action. We identify challenges and opportunities, research them, verify ground truths, and understand local contexts, in order to build innovative strategies that are rooted in reality. Asar convenes multi-stakeholder conversations and helps build relationships between various key actors to be able to sustain collaborations essential to deliver real-world impact. Explore our work Engaging with partners in 10 states Targeting states by 2030 28 Active partners across India 60 dummy 10 Partner with us 10', 'State Climate Action, Maharashtra', 'Programme Officer, State Climate Action, Maharashtra', 'State Climate Action', 'Maharashtra', 'India', 'contact@asar.co.in', '1778407853', 'https://asar.co.in', '{"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://asar.co.in/virtual-exhibition-art-women-and-climate-justice", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/@Asar-India", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fasar.co.in%2Fblog%2Fwhy-budget-allocation-matters-for-climate-literacy-in-tamil-nadu%2F&text=W