('cso-sewa-federation-ed198c90', 'SEWA Federation', 'SEWA Cooperative Federation supports women-owned cooperatives and collectives through capacity building, business development, and policy advocacy to strengthen livelihoods and enterprises.', 'SEWA Cooperative Federation - Gujarat State Women''s SEWA Co-Op Federation Ltd Scroll Top CONTRIBUTE Primary Menu Home About About Us History Mission & Vision Our Co-operatives Our Platforms Organizational Structure Our Team Board of Directors President''s Note Our Services Get Involved Contribute Careers Volunteer Partner Tenders Resources Newsletter - Sahakarita Blog Policy Briefs Reports Annual Reports F.Y. 2024-25 F.Y. 2023-24 F.Y. 2022-23 F.Y. 2021-22 News & Events Awards & Recognition Archive Covid-19 Impact of Covid Relief Reports Contact Through our 106 co-operatives, we have empowered 300,000 socio-economically vulnerable women including women farmers, artisans, care-workers and many others. Empowerment Through Women''s Collectives Learn More Our comprehensive service ecosystem provides our sisters the quality of training and support they need to create scalable and sustainable businesses. Support, Strengthen, Sustain Learn More SEWA has been helping women in the informal economy since 1972. You can help too. A Changing World for Working Women Get Involved About SEWA Federation The Gujarat State Women''s SEWA Cooperative Federation Ltd. was formed on the 31st of December 1992.', 'Ahmedabad, Gujarat', '21/22, Goyal Tower, Near Jhanvi Restaurant, University Road, Panjara Pole, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380015, India', 'Ahmedabad', 'Gujarat', 'India', null, '1537180645750', 'https://www.sewafederation.org', '{"youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbzmJfbJRtEmxBESYIRgYNDqJ9M_Zn1ZQ", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sewafederation.org%2Fdecisions-in-womens-enterprises-carry-more-than-one-meaning%2F", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Decisions+in+Women%E2%8