('cso-mann-deshi-foundation-4d67c859', 'Mann Deshi Foundation', 'Mann Deshi is dedicated to the economic empowerment of rural women. We run a Bank that provides women with affordable and easy access to credit and a Foundation that provides women with the knowledge, skills and support necessary to become successful entrepreneurs with more control over their lives.', 'Mann Deshi Foundation Women''s Empowerment Overview Women''s Bank Business Schools Chambers of Commerce Mann Deshi Mahotsav Community Radio Kickstart Girls Community Empowerment Overview Water Conservation Mann Deshi Champions Bicycles For Girls Healthcare for all Championing Green Centre for Climate Resilient Agriculture People Donate STORIES OF CHANGE MEDIA & RESOURCES FINANCIALS MANN DESHI Mhaswad, Mann Taluka, Satara District, Satara 415509. Maharashtra. India. 1800 2122 112 PARTNERSHIPS & CAREERS [email protected] +91 23 7327 0660 STORIES OF CHANGE AUDIT INFORMATION DONATE Mann Deshi Radio BUY DIRECTLY FROM OUR FARMERS! VIEW OUR PRODUCT DIRECTORY Empowering women entrepreneurs and their communities Access to finance isn''t the only factor for success. Building business skills and access to markets is equally important to unlock the true potential of entrepreneurs. Our vision is to empower women to make their own choices and to be celebrated as equal and valuable members of their families and communities. To learn more about Mann Deshi Mahila Sahakari Bank Ltd please click here . View Annual Report 1. Financial Control Access and control over finance allows women greater freedom o', 'Satara District, Maharashtra', 'Mhaswad, Mann Taluka, Satara District, Satara 415509. Maharashtra. India.', 'Satara District', 'Maharashtra', 'India', 'punefd@manndeshi.org.in', '18002122112', 'https://manndeshifoundation.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/manndeshi.org", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/manndeshiorg?lang=en", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/manndeshi", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.c