('cso-sauramandala-foundation-2d565b63', 'Sauramandala Foundation', 'Sauramandala Foundation is a rural development organisation addressing the challenges faced by remote and inaccessible communities by accelerating social and economical change through collaborative action.', 'Sauramandala Foundation top of page Home Projects About CFAD White Paper Our Partners Our Team Work With Us Newsroom Contact Us Donate to support us! More Use tab to navigate through the menu items. Welcome to Sauramandala Foundation Through our Centre for Accelerated Development (CFAD), we address the challenges faced by remote and inaccessible communities by accelerating social and economic change through collaborative action 4 300000+ 17+ Districts 3000+ States Households Villages For India to attain its 2030 SDGs at the national level it is important for the targets to be realized at the granular village level and our value proposition to address this is by building a sustainable, scalable and inclusive village transformation model to improve the development indicators of those living in India''s most remote villages Know more Our Approach Gain insights and build Social Capital Aggregate NGO partners for collaborative action Evidence generation and policy advocacy Know more Recent Updates Audit Report 2019-20 Audit Report 2020-21 Audit Report 2022-23 Read more Sauramandala Foundation Centre For Accelerated Development Office address C/B 037, Centre Nongrim Hills, Shillong Meghal', 'Centre Nongrim Hills, Meghalaya', 'C/B 037, Centre Nongrim Hills, Shillong Meghalaya 793 003, India', 'Centre Nongrim Hills', 'Meghalaya', 'India', '605a7baede844d278b89dc95ae0a9123@sentry-next.wixpress.com', '2545352419', 'https://www.sauramandala.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/SauraMandala.in", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/sauramandalafoundation", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/sauramandala?lang=en", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/sauramandala", "youtube": "https://www