('cso-plan-foundation-9718f0f8', 'PLAN Foundation', 'PLAN Foundation (India) is part of Plan International, focusing on advancing children''s rights and equality for girls through community-based development programs in health, education, and protection.', 'Home | Participatory Learni top of page Menu Close Home About Our Team Projects Social and Financial Inclusion Annual Reports BUILDING COMMUNITY-LED CLIMATE AND WASTE SOLUTIONS IN INDIA PLAN works with communities, local governments, and institutions to design and strengthen sustainable systems addressing climate, waste, and livelihoods across India. Know more What We Do Our work focuses on strengthening local systems through collaboration with communities and institutions, ensuring climate and waste interventions are context-specific, scalable, and sustainable. Transforming Waste Management Social & Financial Inclusion Citizen Awareness Institution Building How We Work Our approach focuses on building systems that are locally owned, institutionally anchored, and designed to last. COMMUNITY-LED We design and deliver interventions with communities, ensuring solutions respond to local needs and build long-term ownership. SYSTEMS-FOCUSED Our work strengthens underlying systems by aligning policy, infrastructure, financing, and behaviour change rather than addressing symptoms alone. CO-CREATION We work closely with local governments, institutions, and funding partners to co-create sol', 'waste', 'PLAN works with communities, local governments, and institutions to design and strengthen sustainable systems addressing climate, waste, and livelihoods across India.', 'waste', null, 'India', 'saloni.saraf@planfoundation.in', '5177-4725-492', 'https://www.planfoundation.in', '{"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/plan-foundation-india", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/p/PLAN-Foundation-61551923270313", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/plan.foundation_/?hl=en", "x": "https://www.wix.com"}'::jsonb, '[]':