('cso-transitions-research-9f2c1fe9', 'Transitions Research', 'Transitions Research is a Goa-based research organization that explores climate change, sustainability, and transformative futures through systems thinking, data, and participatory research.', 'Transitions Research MENU About Us → → Publications & Events → → Initiatives → → Future Foresight Forum PULL CALL Monsoon Academy Research Themes → → Low Carbon Society Future Cities Digital Society Climate Resilient Society Contact Us → → Subscribe to our Newsletter Subscribe Past Newsletters We explore and shape radical transformations that will determine India''s long-term future. Initiatives Future Foresight Forum Future Foresight Forum guides present-day decisions by anticipating uncertain and complex futures. By identifying proactive, upstream interventions, we aim to ensure long-term sustainability and resilience in the face of emerging challenges and uncertainties. Learn More PULL (People''s Urban Living Lab) PULL(People''s Urban Living Lab) is a platform for co-creating, testing and implementing climate solutions in the real-life and real-use context of India''s mid-sized cities. Our work focuses on developing comprehensive climate solutions, including equitable pathways to net-zero and building resilience of vulnerable communities. Learn More CALL (Climate Adaptation Learning Lab) The Climate Adaptation Learning Lab (CALL) is an innovative, community-driven initiative that br', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', 'hello@transitionsresearch.org', '1740479800', 'https://transitionsresearch.org', '{"x": "https://x.com/transitions_res", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/transitions_research", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/transitions-research"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Climate Change', 'Sustainability', 'Futures Thinking', 'Policy Research', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Think Tanks', 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'Climate adaptation', 'Systems change', 'Futures research', 'Media/