ety Home | Biodiversity Collaborative Skip to main content Search info@biodiversitycollaborative.org Main Menu Home About Our Work Preparatory Phase Project of the National Mission on Biodiversity and Human Well-Being Public engagement and outreach on biodiversity and human well-being linkages Learn Resources Contact A growing network of institutions and people.', now()),
('cso-nature-conservation-foundation-b80037aa', 'Nature Conservation Foundation', 'NCF works to promote science-based conservation of Indiaï¿½s wildlife and habitats, engaging local communities and governments.', 'Nature Conservation Foundation DONATE DONATE Eastern Himalaya Our research is primarily focused on various aspects of hornbill biology, frugivory and seed dispersal, tree phenology and ecological restoration in the tropical forests of North-eastern India, combined with community based conservation activities and nature education - in partnership with government and local community institutions. KNOW MORE High Altitudes NCF and the Snow Leopard Trust work together in India''s high altitudes, striving to help conserve the snow leopard - as well as the diversity of life & landscapes that this beautiful cat symbolizes - in a scientifically robust and socially responsible manner. We combine research, community involvement, conservation education, and policy-level dimensions. KNOW MORE Oceans and Coasts We work in India''s oceanic islands and coasts to understand and support the resilience of coastal and marine ecosystems. Recognising the richness of nearshore ecosystems and their vital importance to coastal societies, we are dedicated to tracking how they respond to climate change and anthropogenic disturbances. KNOW MORE Western Ghats A global biodiversity hotspot and one of the most irr', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', null, '17.894 16.738', 'https://www.ncf-india.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/ncfindia", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/ncfindia", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/ncf.india"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Wildlife Conservation', 'Ecology Research', 'Community Engagement', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Wildlife Conservation', 'Ecology Research', 'Community Engagement', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'Nature Conservat