('cso-south-asia-consortium-for-interdisciplinary-water-resources-studies-saciwaters-76742e8e', 'South Asia Consortium for Interdisciplinary Water Resources Studies (SaciWATERs)', 'SaciWATERs is a policy research organization promoting water resource management through interdisciplinary research and capacity building in South Asia.', 'Home | SaciWaters Our website is undergoing upgrades and will be back soon. In the meantime, please contact info@saciwaters.org for any urgent information or assistance. Need Help? Talk to an Expert +91 40 29998042 / 35174589 Send Message Us at info@saciwaters.org Home About Us Genesis & Vision Our Team Governing Board Core Team Consultant Ex-Eds Advisory Board Knowledge Partners Awards & Recognitions Annual Reports Financial Reports Foreign Contribution Contact Us Our work Networks Academy Knowledge hub Get Involved Climate Change. Women Pay Most. Clean Water. Every Community Vanishing Mangroves. Vulnerable Communities. Safe Water. Every Child. What we do We research water. We shape policy. We act on the ground. Not just a think tank but a Think-Act-Tank, SaciWATERs has been creating real change since 2002, from the Sundarbans to the Himalayas, from classrooms to river basins, building water-secure, climate-resilient futures for South Asia most vulnerable communities. Interdisciplinary Research in Action Through action-oriented research, we co-create knowledge with communities and translate it into policies and actions that matter. Education, Training and Capacity Building We inve', 'Secunderabad, Telangana', 'Plot No. 164, First floor, Road no.6, Vayupuri, Secunderabad, Telangana.', 'Secunderabad', 'Telangana', 'India', 'info@saciwaters.org', '+91 40 29998042', 'https://www.saciwaters.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/people/SaciWATERs/100064418123342", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/SaciWATERs", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/saciwaters", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/saciwaters"}'::jsonb, '["Hy