('cso-earth-focus-bb81c756', 'Earth Focus', 'Empowering indigenous communities & encouraging a nature-based economy WHAT WE DO Our holistic depth model focuses on education and livelihoods built around landscape restoration in the park''s buffer zone. We work with forest-dwelling communities to combine indigenous and local knowledge with scientific and technical know-how to build ecological and socio-economic resilience. About Earth Focus Foundation […]', 'Home - Earth Focus Earth Focus Follow On: Facebook-f Ecoicon-instagram Home About Who We Are Our Team Financial Reports Annual Reports Policy Documents Programmes Media In The News Blogs Features & Awards Short Films Gallery Stop, Look & Wonder Contact DONATE NOW SHOP NOW Menu Home Earth Focus Shaping a Kanha landscape where people and nature thrive together. LEARN MORE Our Pillars of Impact Restoration Education Communities LEARN MORE Donate & Make A Difference Help build a resilient tomorrow Donate Now From Our Pantry The best ingredients for a healthy future SHOP NOW Empowering indigenous communities & encouraging a nature-based economy WHAT WE DO Our holistic depth model focuses on education and livelihoods built around landscape restoration in the park''s buffer zone. We work with forest-dwelling communities to combine indigenous and local knowledge with scientific and technical know-how to build ecological and socio-economic resilience. About Earth Focus Foundation Impact In 4 Years 0 Villages 20 Anganwadis Schools 0 (Acres) Land Restored 1000 Children Impacted 6000 Lives Transformed 0 Saplings Planted Support Us Educate a child Join us in shaping young minds and building a fo', 'Civil Lines, Maharashtra', 'Ramdhan, 245 Rajlaxmi Marg, Chitnavis Layout, Civil Lines, Nagpur - 440001 Maharashtra, India', 'Civil Lines', 'Maharashtra', 'India', 'effkanha@gmail.com', '1777367643', 'https://earthfocus.in/', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/earthfocuskanha", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/earth_focus