Reviewed pages: https://www.gbsanctuary.org', 'approved', now(), 'admin', false, 'Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary A community-based conservation organization that protects and restores native plant diversity in the Western Ghats through research and education. Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary Enter There was a time when humans recognised the power of plants. It was common knowledge that environmental health depended on plant diversity. This awareness survives in a few places, mostly amongst traditional peoples. The onslaught on planetary resilience requires every one of us to protect natural habitat, and to rehabilitate land as well as species. Plants, as the main constituent members of natural ecosystems, are inseparable from global environmental stability. The absolute need for this is now entering areas of public discourse. At the Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary we work closely with the native plants of the Western Ghat mountains in India. Through them we nurture land, water, habitat and community. In this sanctuary: plants, insects, birds, fish, mammals, amphibians, reptiles, fungi, worms and humans, in other words, all living creatures: are sacred. The whole earth, with its mountains, forests, rivers, soils, grasslands, glaciers, winds and oceans, is sacred. Whom do we serve? Enter South India India Plant Conservation Ecology Education Restoration South India Grassroot/Implementation CSOs CRA Partner Map workbook Plant Conservation Ecology Education Restoration South India Grassroot/Implementation CSOs Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary Plant Conservation Ecology Education Restoration Communities South India Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary Gurukula Botanical Sanctuary Enter There was a time when humans recognised the power of plants.', now()),
('cso-hands-on-csr-17389dfe', 'Hands on CSR', 'Hands on CSR connects corporates with credible grassroots projects to implement sustainable and impactful CSR programs.', ':: Hands on CSR :: info@handsoncsr.com Home Projects People Planet About Us Get Involved Services Our Work Video Gallery 2023 - 2024 2022 - 2023 2021 - 2022 2020 - 2021 2019 - 2020 2018 - 2019 Reach Us Bringing change in the Society Join our Community Program Our Mission To engage businesses with making effective physical and financial investments in social projects, thereby ensuring improved company performance and stakeholders'' welfare. Join our Initiative Get Involved with helping hand Join our Corporate Program × Why Choose Hands on CSR ? We assist corporations with creating an empowered, more sustainable, and purposeful future that profits their brand reputation, economy, stakeholders, and the planet. Transparency Assessing your company''s objectives and core values, we provide innovative and sustainable projects that offers a high social return on investment (SROI) Timely Updates Our social auditing and accounting industry veterans conduct systematic assessments demonstrating your company''s social performance over stakeholders'' expectations. Accountability Our social auditing and accounting industry veterans conduct systematic assessments demonstrating your company''s social pe', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', 'info@handsoncsr.com', '1778408308', 'https://www.handsoncsr.com', '{"twitter": "https://twitter.com/Handsoncsr", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/handsoncsr", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/handson.foundation", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/handsoncsr"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['CSR', 'Sustainability', 'Livelihoods', 'Environment', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['CSR', 'Sustainability', 'Livelihoods', 'Environment', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs',