('cso-buzz-women-99b4307c', 'Buzz Women', 'Buzz Women enables underserved women with knowledge, tools, and networks for economic, personal, and ecological empowerment.', 'Buzz Women | Women driving change What we do Our model Our programs Our impact Where we work Where we work India The Gambia The Netherlands Tanzania Kenya Côte d''Ivoire Senegal Ukraine Georgia About us About us Our organization Our reports News & Stories Careers Contact JOIN US DONATE JOIN US DONATE WOMEN DRIVING CHANGE Together we move the world TRANSFORMATION starts from within Buzz Women gives women access to the right tools, knowledge, and support to unlock the potential that''s already within them. Our movement is built on a simple truth: When women rise, they do not rise alone. Families shift. Communities strengthen. Societies tilt toward balance. And the ripple becomes a changing tide. MOBILE SCHOOLS for lasting change With our buses - we call them schools on wheels - we meet women at their doorstep. Women come together in their village to learn practical skills, manage money, grow businesses, and care for their land, themselves and each other. Over time, they become confident decision-makers, entrepreneurs, and changemakers in their homes and communities. This is how lasting change takes root and spreads. On our way to 10 million women by 2032 Since 2012, more than 900,000 w', 'AA', 'Woudenbergseweg 41, Austerlitz, 3711 AA, NL', 'AA', null, 'India', 'info@jun-e-jay.com', '023 - 20 23 174', 'https://www.buzzwomen.org', '{"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/buzzwomen/%20", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/buzzwomen", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/buzzwomen"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Womenï¿½s Empowerment', 'Livelihoods', 'Financial Literacy', 'South India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Womenï¿½s Empowerment', 'Livelihoods', 'Financial Literacy', 'South India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'Buzz Women']::text[], 