('cso-watershed-support-services-and-activities-network-wassan-0589ca9c', 'Watershed Support Services and Activities Network (WASSAN)', 'WASSAN empowers rural India! They craft smart policies for managing resources & support local communities. Their mission: a sustainable future for all', 'Watershed Support Services and Activities Network Home Who We Are Our Story Our Journey Our Approach Our Core Values Our Partners Our Awards and Recognitions What We Do Thematic Areas Ongoing Programs Research Collaborations CSIRO Our Community Our Board Our Team Write a Message Locations near you Resources Financials Annual Reports Case Studies Research Papers Books and Booklets Blog Films Media Coverage Event Reports Posters and Flyers WASSAN Intern''s Blog Training Materials Studies Other Documents BN Yugandhar Fellowship Careers Career Opportunities Volunteers / Internships Request for Proposal (RFP) Login X OUR VISION Entrench participatory processes through network approach that strengthen Natural Resources Management (NRM) practices to secure livelihoods of deprived communities in drought prone areas. OUR PURPOSE Articulate voices and needs of the people and agro-ecologies at margins, in the marginalized rainfed geographies, into public systems and policies to catalyse action at scale. OUR MANDATE Strengthen the civil society space, enable and build their capacities in working with communities and government, network and evolve a policy narrative from evidence and grass roots', 'Department of Agriculture and Farmers'' Empowerment, Odisha', '(FAO India, Department of Agriculture and Farmers'' Empowerment, Government of Odisha)', 'Department of Agriculture and Farmers'' Empowerment', 'Odisha', 'India', 'mail@wassan.org', '1778216804', 'https://wassan.org/', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/WASSANIndia", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/WASSANIndia", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSxzv6bDi29hoOpkm3k02WA", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/wassanindia/mycompany"}'::jsonb, '["Nagole, Hyderabad - 500 068, Telangana, India"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Water', 'Agriculture', 'NRM', 'Policy', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Networks/Alliances', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Water', 'Agriculture', 'NRM', 'Policy', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Networks/Alliances', 'Watershed Support Services and Activities Network (WASSAN)']::text[], 12.9617437, 77.7168019, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://wassan.org/', '{"areas_of_work": ["Water", "Agriculture", "NRM", "Policy"], "beneficiary_groups": ["Women", "Farmers", "Tribal communities", "Children", "Communities", "Rural communities"], "geography_served": ["Pan-India", "India"], "registration_status": "Society", "registration_number": null, "programs": "Watershed Support Services and Activities Network Home Who We Are Our Story Our Journey Our Approach Our Core Values Our Partners Our Awards and Recognitions What We Do Thematic Areas Ongoing Programs Research Collaborations CSIRO Our Community Our Board Our Team Write a Message Locations near you Resources Financials Annual Reports Case Studies Research Papers Books and Booklets Blog Films Media Coverage Event Reports Posters and Flyers WASSAN Intern''s Blog Training Materials Studies Other Doc...", "volunteer_or_partner_needs": null}'::jsonb, 'CRA partner import', 'tanmay@greenruraleconomy.in', 'Source workbook category: Networks/Alliances
