('cso-kheyti-48627315', 'Kheyti', 'We bring an affordable climate-smart farming solution for India''s smallholders. Our greenhouse makes farming productive with low input & high yield quality and quantity.', 'About Us Our Solutions Partners and Supporters Join Us Resources Our Journey Contact Us Empowering farming families with a climate-resilient future Vision & Mission Vision Every farmer is climate resilient through easy access to climate smart technologies. Mission Increase incomes for underserved farmers affected by climate change. Our goal By 2033, we''ll help 1 million farmers build secure, climate-ready livelihoods. One greenhouse at a time. One farmer at a time. With collaboration, change flourishes Equipping a million smallholder farmers with resilience amidst climate tailwinds is difficult. At Kheyti, we are always on the lookout for new avenues of collaboration to benefit India''s smallholder farmers with climate-resilient innovations. Partner With Us Ever wondered if you could make a difference? We believe in building impactful careers that contribute to humanity in the long run. At Kheyti, you will engage with smallholder farmers directly, helping them overcome challenges through innovative, climate-smart solutions. As a Kheyti Changemaker, you will not only build a thriving career but also contribute actively to shaping the future of India''s agriculture. Apply Now Kheyti in', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', null, '42.7554 42.5053', 'https://www.kheyti.com', '{}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Agriculture', 'Climate Adaptation', 'Livelihoods', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Agriculture', 'Climate Adaptation', 'Livelihoods', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'Kheyti']::text[], 22.3511148, 78.6677428, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://www.kheyti.com', '{"areas_of_work": ["Agriculture", "Climate Adaptation", "Livelihoods"], "beneficiary_groups": ["Farmers", "Communities"], "geography_served": ["Pan-India", "India"], "registration_status": null, "registration_number": null, "programs": "About Us Our Solutions Partners and Supporters Join Us Resources Our Journey Contact Us Empowering farming families with a climate-resilient future Vision & Mission Vision Every farmer is climate resilient through easy access to climate smart technologies.", "volunteer_or_partner_needs": null}'::jsonb, 'CRA partner import', 'tanmay@greenruraleconomy.in', 'Source workbook category: Grassroot/Implementation CSOs
