('cso-pradan-2ca76d10', 'Professional Assistance for Development Action (PRADAN)', 'WE BELIEVE that all people, no matter how poor, are capable of driving the change they need. OUR MISSION is to enable the most marginalized people, especially rural women, to earn a decent living and take charge of their own lives.', 'PRADAN - Professional Assistance for Development Action Who We Are Our Origin Our Team Our Board What We Do Our Belief Our Strategy Our Ambition Some of Our Projects LEAP - PROWFIT ASSET START Our Impact Our Impact PRADAN by the Numbers Milestones Partners Publications & Media News Reach Media Media Coverage Press Releases Statutory Reports Annual Reports & Financial Reports Foreign Contribution Perspective Our Field Work Our Logo Join Us Careers Development Apprenticeship Other Opportunities Follow Us Donate Indian Donors Contact Us Donate PRADAN aims to improve the lives of 50 million people in underserved rural India by 2030 . Our vision goes beyond their economic growth, placing equal emphasis on gender equality, nutrition security, and ecological restoration. PRADAN, along with its partners, works with 3.4 million households* spread across 145 districts, and 9 states of India. *As of 31 March 2025 Every passing year, we witness the extraordinary resilience of rural communities in the face of changing climatic conditions. Women, the backbone of rural India''s agriculture, lead efforts to access land rights, markets, and credit through Farmer Producer Organizations. Their resilie', 'Madhya Pradesh', 'Meet Meera Devi from Kutela Gram in Dindori District in Madhya Pradesh, India. Meera has been', null, 'Madhya Pradesh', 'India', null, '15345443-37', 'https://www.pradan.net', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/pradanofficialpage?ref=hl", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/PRADAN_India", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/user/Pradanat30", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/professional-assistance-for-development-action/mycompany", "instagr