('cso-gram-vikas-c94f232e', 'Gram Vikas', 'Gram Vikas is a development organisation enabling sustainable and equitable processes for a dignified quality of life of the rural communities.', 'Home - Gram Vikas submit Why Us Vision & Approach We envision an equitable and sustainable society where people live in peace with dignity. Impact Our work promotes sustainable development processes in rural communities. Recognition Our work has received national and global recognition. Our Work Overview Our work responds to the needs of the communities. Decade Five We aim to enable resilient, dignified lives for five million people by 2030. Our focus areas are the pillars of work that interact to manage the multidisciplinarity of development problems and their solutions. Water Livelihoods Sanitation & Health Habitat & Technology Village Institutions Education & Youth Disaster Response About Us History Our legacy is of enabling rural communities to lead a dignified life. Ethos & Culture Our ethos guide our work and shape the culture. Board & Team We are driven by our commitment to equity and dignity for all. Mandatory Disclosure Audited financial statements and annual activity reports. Blog Stories and updates from Gram Vikas. Library Research reports, articles and case studies on our work. Partners Donate We partner with rural communities to enable them to lead a dignified life. W', 'Bhubaneswar, Odisha', 'Bhubaneswar - 751009, Odisha, India', 'Bhubaneswar', 'Odisha', 'India', 'info@gramvikas.org', '1776791612', 'https://www.gramvikas.org', '{"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/gram-vikas-gv/?viewAsMember=true", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/gramvikasodisha", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/gramvikasodisha", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/GramVikasIN", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVGjjrm0NiDe2l4lI1_A0-A?view_as=subscriber"}'::jsonb, '["Before joining us, she worked with Aga Khan Rural Support Programme (AKRSP, India), DISHA, Madhyam Foundation, Antodaya, and other nonprofits in and outside Odisha."]'::jsonb, ARRAY['WASH', 'Habitat', 'Livelihoods', 'East India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['WASH', 'Habitat', 'Livelihoods', 'East India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'Gram Vikas']::text[], 20.2602964, 85.8394521, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://www.gramvikas.org', '{"areas_of_work": ["WASH", "Habitat", "Livelihoods"], "beneficiary_groups": ["Women", "Youth", "Farmers", "Tribal communities", "Adolescents", "Children", "Entrepreneurs", "Communities", "Rural communities"], "geography_served": ["East India"], "registration_status": "Society", "registration_number": null, "programs": "Home - Gram Vikas submit Why Us Vision & Approach We envision an equitable and sustainable society where people live in peace with dignity.", "volunteer_or_partner_needs": null}'::jsonb, 'CRA partner import', 'tanmay@greenruraleconomy.in', 'Source workbook category: Grassroot/Implementation CSOs
