('cso-himalaya-unnati-mission-7ffcb54c', 'Himalaya Unnati Mission', 'Himalay Unnati Mission is a movement to protect, foster & resurrect the biological, cultural and spiritual heritage of the Himalayas.', 'Save Himalayas- Himalay Unnati Mission Home About Us Art of Living What We Do HUM Secretariat Our Presence Thematic Areas THEMATIC AREAS Ecological Heritage Economic Heritage Socio Cultural Heritage Spiritual Heritage Impact OUR IMPACT Ecological Impact Economic Impact Socio Cultural Impact Spiritual Impact HUM Partners Volunteer Speaks Contact Us The Himalayan Way of Life PRESERVE & PROTECT CONFLUENCE OF IDEAS AND BEST PRACTICES Partnerships with NGOs Working for Himalayas HIMALAYAS - THE PRIDE OF INDIA HUM Projects on Himalayan Ecosystem JOIN THE MOVEMENT! Our Vision A movement to explore, foster and protect the spiritual, socio-cultural, economic and ecological heritage of the Himalayas through traditional wisdom, science, policy and action. Our Mission To facilitate, nurture and create empowered local leadership in pursuit of augmenting and disseminating knowledge, practices and competencies. Resultantly, develop leaders and teams rooted in research, field interventions and advocacy across HUM''s thematic areas in the spirit of global consciousness towards holistic wellbeing, along with sustainable development. 0 Knowledge Partners Organisations working in Himalayas 0 Knowledge', 'Indian Air Force veteran of 37 years. Served at the apex level in IAF Administration', 'Indian Air Force veteran of 37 years. Served at the apex level in IAF Administration, as ''Air Force Officer in Charge Administration '' (AOA).', 'Indian Air Force veteran of 37 years. Served at the apex level in IAF Administration', null, 'India', null, '6986549935', 'https://himalayunnatimission.ssrdp.org/', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/hum4himalayas", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/hum4himalayas", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/hum4himalayas", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/himalaya-unnati-mission"}'::jsonb, '["Mr. Yogesh Gaur / Mr. Rohit Ranjan Art of living Gyan Mandir, Lane 3, Adarsh Enclave, Trikuta Nagar Extension Jammu, Jammu and Kashmir, 180012", "Sri Sri Gyan Mandir, The Palace Building, Fingask Estate, Near Kali Bari Temple, The mall, Shimla Urban(T), Himachal Pradesh, 171003", "DDKS hall, Kotla Nala, Solan, Himachal Pradesh 173212", "Rishikesh Ashram The Art of Living, Ved Vignan Maha Vidya Peeth, Gali No. 13, Seesham Jhadi, Muni Ki Reti,Dist. Tehri Garhwal Rishikesh, Uttarakhand, 249137", "Ved Vignan Maha Vidya Peeth, Nakot, Tehri Garhwal,, Faigul, Uttarakhand 249137", "The Art of Living Happiness Centre, 233,phase 2,Vasant Vihar Dehradun Vasant Vihar Lovely Market, Sahaspur, Dehradun, Uttarakhand 248006"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Mountain Livelihoods', 'Climate Resilience', 'North India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Mountain Livelihoods', 'Climate Resilience', 'North India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'Himalaya Unnati Mission']::text[], 23.9817237, 85.3713535, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://himalayunnatimission.ssrdp.org/', '{"areas_of_work": ["Mountain Livelihoods", "Climate Resilience"], "beneficiary_groups": ["Women", "Youth", "Tribal communities", "Children", "Entrepreneurs", "Communities", "Rural communities"], "geography_served": ["North India"], "registration_status": "Society", "registration_number": null, "programs": "Save Himalayas- Himalay Unnati Mission Home About Us Art of Living What We Do HUM Secretariat Our Presence Thematic Areas THEMATIC AREAS Ecological Heritage Economic Heritage Socio Cultural Heritage Spiritual Heritage Impact OUR IMPACT Ecological Impact Economic Impact Socio Cultural Impact Spiritual Impact HUM Partners Volunteer Speaks Contact Us The Himalayan Way of Life PRESERVE & PROTECT CONFLUENCE OF IDEAS AND BEST PRACTICES Partnerships with NGOs Working for Himalayas HIMALAYAS - THE PRID...", "volunteer_or_partner_needs": null}