('cso-cept-research-and-development-foundation-983170d7', 'CEPT Research and Development Foundation', 'The CEPT Research and Development Foundation (CRDF) is a multidisciplinary think tank, aims to provide cutting-edge research, advisory and capacity-building support to positively shape human habitats.', 'Home | CEPT Research and Development Foundation × Search About Us About CRDF Recognition and Awards Mandatory Disclosures Centers Center for Advanced Research in Building Science and Energy Center for Applied Geomatics Center for Heritage Conservation Center for Research on Architecture and Urbanism Center for Urban Planning and Policy Center for Water and Sanitation Center of Excellence in Infrastructure Center of Excellence in Urban Transport Design Innovation & Craft Resource Center (Archived Center) Projects Research Capacity Building Advisory Projects Training Knowledge Resources Podcast Open Geo AI: Unveiling Satellite Insights through Open Data Data for Disaster Risk Reduction Book-a-Week Data-Knowledge-Action for Urban Systems Data for Resilient Cities Events All Events CEPT Conference People Work With Us Professional Fellows Program Opportunities Contact WASH Economics Conference 2026 The fourth edition of the WASH Economics Conference will be held on April 17-18, 2026, at CEPT University, Ahmedabad, India. Know more Previous Next Advancing knowledge and action on built environment and human habitats Welcome to the CEPT Research and Development Foundation (CRDF). CRDF is a', 'Maharashtra', 'C-WAS felicitated by President of India for Swachh Maharashtra More Details', null, 'Maharashtra', 'India', 'crdf@cept.ac.in', '1584016349', 'https://crdf.org.in', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/CeptResearch", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/CeptResearch", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/ceptresearch", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/ceptresearch"}'::jsonb, '["CoE-UT was presented the Second Runner''s Up Award for Alternative Analysis of H