('cso-mahila-housing-sewa-trust-751ba37f', 'Mahila Housing SEWA Trust', 'Mahila Housing Trust is a grassroots development organization that is devoted to assisting women in the creation of grassroots institutions to promote gender inclusive cities and sustainable development to the communities of urban India.', 'Grassroots Development Organization and NGO | Mahila Housing Trust Select Language Arabic Dutch English French German Gujarati Hindi Italian Japanese Kannada Marathi Russian Donate Now Home Awards & Recognitions About About the Organization 25 Years of MHT Financials Press Room Careers Practice Areas Equitable Access to Water and Sanitation Building Climate Resilience and Energy Efficiency Securing Women''s Rights to Land and Housing, Women Empowerment Microlending for Habitat Improvement Advancing Participation in Governance and Planning Livelihoods in Construction Improving Community Infrastructure and Public Spaces Disaster Response and Recovery Impact Awards & Recognitions Changing Lives News & Updates MHT in Media Blogs Knowledge Hub Resources COVID-19 Impact Survey State of the Homeless (Ahmedabad) Contact Home Awards & Recognitions About About the Organization 25 Years of MHT Financials Press Room Careers Practice Areas Equitable Access to Water and Sanitation Building Climate Resilience and Energy Efficiency Securing Women''s Rights to Land and Housing, Women Empowerment Microlending for Habitat Improvement Advancing Participation in Governance and Planning Livelihoods in Con', 'Ellisbridge, Gujarat', 'Opp. M.J. Library, Ellisbridge, Ahmedabad-380006 Gujarat, India.', 'Ellisbridge', 'Gujarat', 'India', '%20info@mahilahsg.org', '1662011138', 'https://www.mahilahousingtrust.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/Mahilahsg", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/mht_mahilahsg", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/mahilahsg", "linkedin": "https://in.linkedin.com/company/gujarat-mahila-housing-sewa-trust", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/