('cso-solid-waste-management-roundtable-swmrt-79524c70', 'Solid Waste Management Roundtable (SWMRT)', 'The Solid Waste Management Round Table (SWMRT) is a collective of SWM practitioners working on promoting decentralised sustainable waste management and inclusive livelihoods.', 'Who We Are | SWMRT top of page HOME ABOUT Who We Are What We Do Team Partners WORK Campaigns Policy Programs Education LIBRARY Resources Blog CONNECT Contact Volunteer Donate More Use tab to navigate through the menu items. About Home > About > Who We Are Who We Are The Solid Waste Management Round Table (SWMRT) is a collective of SWM practitioners working on promoting decentralised sustainable waste management and inclusive livelihoods. Our Vision To reimagine waste as a resource. Our Mission To steer the transition into a low-waste world powered by the circular economy principles, decentralised and sustainable waste management practices by connecting with communities, industry, institutions, governments, formal and informal waste workers through the promotion of replicable and inclusive models for improved health, environment and dignity to livelihoods. Awards 2014 - 2015 The Karnataka State Environment Awards - 2015 issued by the Karnataka State Pollution Control Board. The award was given to organisations in recognition of their outstanding contribution to environmental protection 2013 - 2014 Rotary NGO Award for Excellence as Social Cha nge Maker - 2013-14 2011 - 2012 Na', 'SWMRT has spearheaded several key community-based campaigns that have influenced significant policy decisions in Bengaluru, Karnataka', 'Since its inception, SWMRT has spearheaded several key community-based campaigns that have influenced significant policy decisions in Bengaluru, Karnataka and pan India.', 'SWMRT has spearheaded several key community-based campaigns that have influenced significant policy decisions in Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'India', 'email@example.com', '2545352419', 'https://www.swmrt.com', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/swmrtbengaluru", "twitter": "https://www.twitter.com/swmrtbengaluru", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/swmrtbengaluru", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkLvzG9eFFLrmKPs56piRqA", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/solid-waste-management-roundtable-swmrt"}'::jsonb, '["Since 2009, we have been working with various stakeholders building a roadmap of decentralised waste management to address the need for resource recovery policy and zero-waste-to-landfill policy for India."]'::jsonb, ARRAY['1. Sustainable municipal waste systems 2. Community-led organic waste management 3. Informal sector inclusion 4. Capacity Building', 'South India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['1. Sustainable municipal waste systems 2. Community-led organic waste management 3. Informal sector inclusion 4. Capacity Building', 'South India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'Solid Waste Management Roundtable (SWMRT)']::text[], 17.3615965, 78.4276746, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://www.swmrt.com', '{"areas_of_work": ["1. Sustainable municipal waste systems 2. Community-led organic waste management 3. Informal sector inclusion 4. Capacity Building"], "beneficiary_groups": ["Farmers", "Children", "Communities", "Rural communities"], "geography_served": ["South India"], "registration_status": "Section 8", "registration_number": null, "programs": "Who We Are | SWMRT top of page HOME ABOUT Who We Are What We Do Team Partners WORK Campaigns Policy Programs Education LIBRARY Resources Blog CONNECT Contact Volunteer Donate More Use tab to navigate through the menu items.", "volunteer_or_partner_needs": null}'::jsonb, 'CRA partner import', 'tanmay@greenruraleconomy.in', 'Source workbook category: Grassroot/Implementation CSOs
