('cso-janaagraha-c5259925', 'Janaagraha', 'Creating cities of, by, and for the people Building cities that offer citizens a high quality of living requires a rethinking: of how we understand cities, how they are governed, and how we approach urban challenges. We must view cities as economic and governance units and address the root causes…', 'Janaagraha - Transforming quality of life in India''s cities and towns Janaagraha''s Urban Conclave | 18 March 2026 | See details Janaagraha''s Urban Conclave | 18 March 2026 | See details What We Do Planning and Design Decentralised Participatory Governance State Capacities Who We Work With Conclave 2026 Resources About Journey Theory of Change Culture Codes Recognition People In the News Donors Annual Reports Get Involved What We Do Planning and Design Decentralised Participatory Governance State Capacities Who We Work With Conclave 2026 About Theory of Change Culture Codes Donors Recognition Annual Reports Journey People Resources Get Involved Transforming quality of life in India''s cities and towns We strengthen how cities are planned, designed, governed, and funded - so they work for everyone who calls them home. Get Involved Learn More Planning and Design Decentralised Participatory Governance State Capacities Our cities are struggling Cities are engines of economic prosperity. They attract migrants seeking hope, better opportunities, and a more secure tomorrow. By 2050, 814 million Indians will call cities home-nearly double today''s urban population. Yet the pace of urbanisatio', 'Bengaluru, Karnataka', '19/4, "Sair Bagh" Building, 3rd Floor, Cunningham Road, Bengaluru, Karnataka, India - 560052', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'India', 'anu@email.com', '1999999999', 'https://www.janaagraha.org', '{"twitter": "https://twitter.com/Janaagraha1", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/janaagraha-centre-for-citizenship-and-democracy", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/janaagraha/?hl=en", "facebook": "https://www.fa