('cso-veditum-60344a2d', 'Veditum', 'Veditum India Foundation is an action oriented not-for-profit organization, working to transform India''s environmental governance landscape.', 'Home - Veditum India Foundation Skip to content Veditum India Foundation Menu expanded collapsed About us Organisation Work with Veditum Veditum''s Newsletter POSH at Veditum How to help Veditum Activity Reports Projects Moving Upstream India Sand Watch Kolkata Change Makers City Water Walks Bihar Floods Monitoring Fellowship Publishing Articles Documentary Sediment Stories India Sand Watch: A journey map Life along River Ken (a colouring series) Donate Home Veditum is a not-for-profit research, media and action oriented organization based out of Kolkata, India - registered as a Section 8 company. Our work is situated at the intersection of environmental and social justice. We are transforming the environmental governance landscape of India by creating evidence at scale, empowering communities to take action, and creating empathetic environmental leaders for the future. Our current work focuses on India''s river ecosystems, freshwater resources and communities & biodiversity that are dependent on them, and the governance of these systems. Veditum''s founder Siddharth has been awarded the Sanctuary Wildlife Service Award 2025 Siddharth is one of the recipients o f The Wildlife Service', 'South India', null, null, null, 'India', 'asid@veditum.org', '2147483647', 'https://veditum.org', '{"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/awaazleadershiplabs/?originalSubdomain=in", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/veditum", "twitter": "https://www.twitter.com/veditum", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/veditum", "x": "https://x.com/mohitmrao"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Localisation', 'Sustainability', 'South India', 'Networks/Alliances', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Localisation', 'Sustainability', 'South India', 'Networks/Alliances', 'Veditum']::text[], 22.3511148, 7