('cso-praja-402c3c30', 'Praja', 'Urban governance advocacy and research organisation that tracks civic budgets, governance and service delivery.', 'PRAJA - Making Democracy Work Login Contact Us About Us Follow Us Login Contact Us About Us Reports/Publications Urban Governance Reports Newsletters Data Analysis for Governance Urban Governance Dashboard Mumbai Delhi Impact Stories Media Room Testimonials Events Get Involved Work With Us Volunteer Content Policy Privacy Policy Disclaimer Sitemap Donate National Consultation On Urban Governance- Key Finding From 21 States Know More Praja''s Urban Governance Index 2020 Know More Prajatantra 2022-23 Grand Finale Know More Previous Next What Praja is a non-partisan organisation working towards enabling accountable governance since 1997. Praja envisions improving the quality of life for all through simplifying people''s lives, creating tools for better governance and making democracy work. Why Praja believes that the governance structures in urban India lack true grassroots democracy. Local elected representatives and local governments are not sufficiently empowered and not responsive to the citizens which is the cause for lack of effective governance. How Praja works with key urban governance stakeholders including elected representatives, administration, media and citizens to address', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', null, null, 'https://www.praja.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/praja.org", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/Prajafoundation", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/user/PrajaFoundation1999", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/515558/admin/feed/posts", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/prajafoundation"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Urban governance', 'Accountability', 'Civic data', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Urban governance', 'Accountability', 'Civic data', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implem