('cso-kashtakari-panchayat-c2d40b41', 'Kashtakari Panchayat', 'Farmer collective and grassroots organisation focusing on agroecology, farmer rights and sustainable livelihoods.', 'Kashtakari Panchayat - Reclaiming lives and livelihoods Toggle navigation About Us Trustees A Brief History of Pune''s Waste pickers Contact Us Our Work ITC Multilayered Plastic Recovery Initiative Annual Reports Resources Recycling Machinery Sale Donate Join us Follow Us Skip to content About Us Trustees A Brief History of Pune''s Waste pickers Contact Us Our Work ITC Multilayered Plastic Recovery Initiative Annual Reports Resources Recycling Machinery Sale Donate Join us Search for: Toggle sidebar & navigation Kashtakari Panchayat Reclaiming lives and livelihoods Scroll down to content About Us Kashtakari Panchayat is an organisation working with and for waste pickers. Waste pickers make a living collecting, sorting, cleaning, compressing, refurbishing, aggregating, transporting and recycling materials that others throw away. It is the labour of waste pickers that turns discarded waste into raw materials that re-enter the materials economy for reuse and recycling. Every kilogram of waste reclaimed by a waste picker, is one kilogram less for the municipal waste management system to handle. The work of waste pickers contributes to local economies, public health and environmental sust', 'Shukrawar Peth', 'Administrative Office: Plot No. 12, C.T.S 1048, PDMT Bhavan, Hirabaug Chowk, Shukrawar Peth, Pune 411002', 'Shukrawar Peth', null, 'India', 'kashtakaripanchayat@gmail.com', '19.196 13.143', 'https://kashtakaripanchayat.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/kastakaripanchayat", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/kashtakari_panchayat"}'::jsonb, '["Registered Address: Flat No-5, 2 nd Floor Nanik Nivas, Agarwal Colony, H.no- 793/6, Bhavani Peth Pune -411002"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Agroecology', 'Farmer organising', 'Livelihoods', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Grassroot/Implementation CSOs', 'C