('csr_philanthropy-south-asia-women-foundation-india-sawf-in-aa27a903', 'South Asia Women Foundation India (SAWF-IN)', 'South Asia Women Foundation India, SAWF IN, is the national women''s fund in India.', 'SAWF IN Array Home Who We Are Our Vision & Mission Our Board Story So Far Reports and Finance What We Do Influencing Philanthropy Convening critical spaces Grants and Fellowships Legal Fellowship Program Economic and Environmental Justice Fellowship Small Grants Programme Our Resources Covid Response Partner with us Blog New Publication - Women in Philanthropy New Publication! Weaving a New Narrative - "Women Shaping the Philanthropic Landscape in India" South Asia Women Foundation India (SAWF IN) South Asia Women Foundation India (SAWF IN) is a national women''s fund in India. Our core purpose is to ensure a continuous and committed flow of resources, both financial and non-financial) to support initiatives led by and working towards advancing the rights of women and trans* persons discriminated against due to caste, class, ethnicity and other forms of marginalisation. SAWF IN envisions a world where women, girls, and trans* persons realise their constitutional rights and freedoms to equality and non-discrimination. Therefore, we believe in advocating and influencing resource agencies and philanthropists (individuals, institutions, CSRs, and others) to commit long-term, continuous', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', 'info@womensfundindia.org', null, 'https://www.sawfindia.org', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/sawf.india.9", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/south-asia-women-foundation-india-645841178", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/sawfindia"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Gender Justice', 'Women''s Rights', 'LGBTQIA+ Rights', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Funders', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Gender Justice', 'Women''s Rights', 'LGBTQIA+ Rights', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Funders', 'South Asia Women Foundation India (S