('csr_philanthropy-bharath-agroecology-fund-116fa88c', 'Bharath Agroecology Fund', 'A multi-donor fund supporting agroecology movements and sustainable food systems through farmer-led initiatives and natural farming.', 'Bharat Agroecology Fund Skip to content Home About Our Roots Why Agroecology Grantmaking Grantmaking Grantees Round 1 Round 2 Round 3 Round 4 BAF''s Value to Funders Join Hands Home About Our Roots Why Agroecology Grantmaking Grantmaking Grantees Round 1 Round 2 Round 3 Round 4 BAF''s Value to Funders Join Hands We are a part of the global Agroecology Fund (AEF) Pooled Grantmaking to Support Agroecological Solutions Across India seeding change Pooled Grantmaking to Support Agroecological Solutions Across India The misguided and poorly named "green revolution" has failed both the planet and people. The climate can''t sustain agriculture''s growing dependence on fossil fuels, just as India''s farmers suffer enormously from an unstable climate. The number of farmer suicides is a heart-breaking reminder of just how broken our food system is. We need immediate action for truly sustainable and equitable food systems grounded in dignified livelihoods and family and ecosystem health, guided by the knowledge and experience of India''s small farmers, who are increasingly adopting natural farming and circular economy practices. An agroecological food system lifts up India''s remarkably diverse cuisi', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', null, '1.9444444444444', 'https://bharatagroecologyfund.org', '{}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Agroecology', 'Sustainable Agriculture', 'Food Systems', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Funders', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Agroecology', 'Sustainable Agriculture', 'Food Systems', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Funders', 'Bharath Agroecology Fund']::text[], 22.3511148, 78.6677428, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://bharatagroecologyfund.org', '{"focus_areas": ["Agroecology", "Sustainable Agriculture", "Food Systems"], "