Reviewed pages: https://bharatagroecologyfund.org; https://bharatagroecologyfund.org/about', 'approved', now(), 'admin', false, 'Bharath Agroecology Fund A multi-donor fund supporting agroecology movements and sustainable food systems through farmer-led initiatives and natural farming. Bharat Agroecology Fund Skip to content Home About Our Roots Why Agroecology Grantmaking Grantmaking Grantees Round 1 Round 2 Round 3 Round 4 BAF''s Value to Funders Join Hands Home About Our Roots Why Agroecology Grantmaking Grantmaking Grantees Round 1 Round 2 Round 3 Round 4 BAF''s Value to Funders Join Hands We are a part of the global Agroecology Fund (AEF) Pooled Grantmaking to Support Agroecological Solutions Across India seeding change Pooled Grantmaking to Support Agroecological Solutions Across India The misguided and poorly named "green revolution" has failed both the planet and people. The climate can''t sustain agriculture''s growing dependence on fossil fuels, just as India''s farmers suffer enormously from an unstable climate. The number of farmer suicides is a heart-breaking reminder of just how broken our food system is. We need immediate action for truly sustainable and equitable food systems grounded in dignified livelihoods and family and ecosystem health, guided by the knowledge and experience of India''s small farmers, who are increasingly adopting natural farming and circular economy practices. An agroecological food system lifts up India''s remarkably diverse cuisi Pan-India, India India Agroecology Sustainable Agriculture Food Systems Pan-India India Funders CRA Partner Map workbook Agroecology Sustainable Agriculture Food Systems Pan-India India Funders Bharath Agroecology Fund Agroecology Sustainable Agriculture Food Systems Pan-India India Philanthropic grant Farmers Communities Rural communities https://bharatagroecologyfund.org/grantmaking', now()),
('csr_philanthropy-s3idf-be0714f4', 'S3IDF', 'Supports small-scale, pro-poor infrastructure projects through financing and technical assistance.', 'Home - S3IDF - OUR MISSION S3IDF strengthens entrepreneurial ecosystems and supports impact enterprises to combat climate change, poverty, and gender inequality. - OUR MISSION S3IDF strengthens entrepreneurial ecosystems and supports impact enterprises to combat climate change, poverty, and gender inequality. Our Approach By equipping early-stage entrepreneurs with the necessary tools, resources, and training we help them build resilient and successful enterprises. Read More Our Programmes We catalyse a more circular, socially and financially inclusive economy by providing entrepreneurs with financial, technical and training services. Agriculture Energy Waste Get Involved How can you enable change? Learn more about joining, partnering with or supporting S3IDF. Read More S3IDF-India is a Section 8 nonprofit Useful Links Contact Financials and Legal Timeline Terms of Use News Centre S3IDF''s History Join The Newsletter Get the latest news from S3IDF Subscribe Terms of Use © 2024 Small Scale Sustainable Infrastructure Development Fund (S3IDF) Follow Us GENERAL Home About Us Frequently Asked Questions Financials and Legal News Centre PROGRAMMES & PROJECTS Our Sectors of Focus Approach G', 'South India', null, null, null, 'India', null, '1610377967', 'https://s3idf.in', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/S3IDF", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/400876/admin", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnWGpCb9cvUKS2BX6U3bjOA"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Infrastructure', 'Energy Access', 'Livelihoods', 'South India', 'Funders', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Infrastructure', 'Energy Access', 'Livelihoods', 'South India', 'Funders', 'S3IDF']::text[], 22.3511148, 78.6677428, 'CRA Partner Map workbook', 'https://s3idf.in', '{"focus_areas": ["Infrastructure", "Energy Access", "Livelihoods"], "geo