Reviewed pages: https://india.mongabay.com/about/; https://india.mongabay.com/about', 'approved', now(), 'admin', false, 'Mongabay India Mongabay India is an environmental news platform publishing evidence-based stories on forests, wildlife, and conservation. About Mongabay India Features Videos Podcasts Specials Articles Shorts Subscribe English Español (Spanish) Français (French) Bahasa Indonesia (Indonesian) Brasil (Portuguese) India (English) हिंदी (Hindi) বাংলা (Bengali) Swahili Videos Podcasts Articles Short News Feature Stories The Latest Explore All About Team Contact Subscribe page Submissions Privacy Policy Terms of Use Advertising Wild Madagascar For Kids Mongabay.org Reforestation App Planetary Health Check Conservation Effectiveness Mongabay Data Studio Mongabay India is an environment and conservation platform that brings high-quality, original reports from nature''s frontline in India. We look at India''s development through the prism of environment and conservation. Mongabay India is the India-specific portal of mongabay.com , and is published in English and Hindi . Rhett A. Butler founded mongabay.com in 1999 out of his passion for tropical forests. He named the site Mongabay after an island in Madagascar. Our main interests are forests, wildlife, oceans, and the conservation sector. We also undertake deep dives on specific topics and geographies. Mongabay''s readership includes conservationists, scientists, policymakers, Pan-India, India India Environment Journalism Conservation Awareness Pan-India India Media/Citizen Engagement CRA Partner Map workbook Environment Journalism Conservation Awareness Pan-India India Media/Citizen Engagement Mongabay India Social Media Video Audio Written https://www.youtube.com/@MongabayIndia https://www.instagram.com/mongabayindia https://www.linkedin.com/company/mongabay-india https://www.facebook.com/mongabayindia https://india.mongabay.com/about/ X | https://x.com/mongabayindia Pan-India India https://india.mongabay.com/videos https://india.mongabay.com/podcasts https://india.mongabay.com/articles https://india.mongabay.com/shorts https://india.mongabay.com/features https://india.mongabay.com/?s=&formats=post+custom_story+videos+podcasts+specials+short_article https://india.mongabay.com/video/2026/03/the-desperate-battle-of-mizorams-farmers-with-rats https://india.mongabay.com/podcast/2024/08/podcast-wild-frequencies-humans-and-wildlife-adaptation', now()),
('story_teller-youcan-bb1ef843', 'YouCan', 'YouCan Foundation empowers young people to drive social change through leadership, volunteering, and advocacy, including environmental initiatives.', 'Home | YouCAN Website top of page Home About Us People Programs Fellowship Report Cohort 4 Fellows Testimonials Resources Blog Connect Alumni More Use tab to navigate through the menu items. EEF 4.0 Snapshot out now! Click to read Invest in Educators for a prosperous India Here''s How Inspire. Empower. Nurture. Environmental apathy is the root cause of the climate crisis. Still, most of India''s largest demographic - the 260 million K-12 students complete school without connecting with nature and knowing the intricacies of climate change. That''s why YouCAN functions as a mission-driven non-profit organisation founded with the vision of an Earth Educator in every school and learning space in India. We improve opportunities for K-12 students to connect with nature locally and practice climate action during their formative years. YouCAN is an initiative of the Trust for Environmental Education. Read Founders'' Note Our Program Earth Educators Fellowship Enquire with us The Earth Educators Fellowship brings together 20 young environmentalists, emerging grassroots conservationists, school teachers, and informal educators who have an enterprising spirit to challenge the status quo of nature', 'Pan-India, India', null, null, null, 'India', '605a7baede844d278b89dc95ae0a9123@sentry-next.wixpress.com', '2545352419', 'https://www.youcan.in/', '{"facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/youcanedu", "instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/youcanedu", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/youcanedu"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Youth Leadership', 'Environment', 'Civic Action', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Media/Citizen Engagement', 'CRA Partner Map workbook']::text[], ARRAY['Youth Leadership', 'Environment', 'Civic Action', 'Pan-India', 'India', 'Media/Citizen Engagement', 'YouCan']::text[], 22.3511148