('story_teller-jagriti-yatra-jecp-e6bf6a05', 'Jagriti Yatra- JECP', 'JECP is a cutting-edge incubation center in Deoria, UP dedicated to empowering small and medium enterprises across Tier 2 and 3 districts of India through innovation, incubation, and inspiration.', 'JECP - Jagriti Enterprise Centre Purvanchal | Building India Through Enterprise Home Who We Are JECP Our Programs Our Impact Life@Jagriti Media & Resources Get Involved Home Who We Are About Us JECP Board JECP Team Future Roadmap JECP About JECP Our Approach Our Facilities Network Offices Our Programs Incubation Overview Our Mentors Our Partners Innovation Inspiration Our Impact Life@Jagriti Media & Resources Get Involved Partner Mentor Volunteer Facilities Tender Apply Newsletter Contact BUILDING INDIA THROUGH ENTERPRISE Every small idea can carry the weight of a nation! THE INCUBATION GROUND Where local dreams find roots and grow into enterprises! THE BANYAN REVOLUTION One shade many branches - A movement of grassroots prosperity! OUR UDYAMIS, OUR PRIDE Every face here is a story of courage, grit, and hope! JOIN THE JOURNEY Together we nurture the enterprise of a rising Bharat! 1 / 5 " Green Enterprise Cohort 3.0 launched with 22 New Enterprises. " " Azeedo Pvt. Ltd. wins ₹5 Lakh in Impact Quest 2.0. " " Earth Rakshak diverts 40 kg of Waste to Sales. " " Chaimitra wins Best Newcomer - Tea Café (North), 2025. " " MoU with CRB supporting 25 FPOs and ~15,000 farmers. " " Women CoE e', 'Pan-India, India', 'Vill - Araipar, PO - Barpar, Baitalpur, Deoria, UP, 274201, IN', null, null, 'India', 'support@jagriti.org', '+91 8887052172', 'https://jecp.in', '{"instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/jecpurvanchal", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/jecpurvanchal", "facebook": "https://www.facebook.com/jecpurvanchal", "twitter": "https://twitter.com/jecpurvanchal", "youtube": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2okzHcmC6erjgMrGQuttJg"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Entrepreneurship', 'Youth Leadership', '